# Online appointment booking

## Problem

Patients can only book by phone, so lines are busy and slots go unused.

## Users

- Patients
- Front-desk staff

## Goals

- Patients book without calling

## Scope

- Book, reschedule and cancel in the app

## Out of scope

- Payments

## User flows

### Book a visit

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[Open app] --> B[Pick slot] --> C[Confirm]
```

## Screens

### Slot picker

A week view with free slots.

## Success metrics

| Metric | Target |
|---|---|
| Online bookings | ≥ 60% within 3 months |

## Risks

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| No-shows rise | Reminders 24 h before |
